                                "sense_id": "b774724c-2f8a-3d56-a7cc-3bd02866cd68",
                                "text": "This section uses a survey of thirteen couples to look at typical shorthanded solutions to watchkeeping and then discusses some standard watch schedules for doublehanded crews."
