                                "sense_id": "b8e177c9-6f6d-30a4-950d-874c72b5f052",
                                "text": "When a double-handed person turned, the ropes would hit against each other, spiraling in lopsided arcs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "093fc582-1b5b-4d07-81cd-e599e2dd0dbb",
                                "sense_id": "b8e177c9-6f6d-30a4-950d-874c72b5f052",
                                "text": "Of the ancient doublehanded espadons of the Switzer, I have, in this way, received, I think, not less than six, in excellent preservation, from as many different individuals, who thus testified their general approbation of these pages."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4fd4edeb-02d0-491a-b09c-cfe1298e8d21",
                                "sense_id": "b8e177c9-6f6d-30a4-950d-874c72b5f052",
                                "text": "It is this doublehanded judgement that Personal Services seeks to expose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e455afbc-48fe-4ad4-ba99-a1d70880c40e",
                                "sense_id": "b8e177c9-6f6d-30a4-950d-874c72b5f052",
                                "text": "It is with this ambiguity in mind that one can begin a serious deconstructive, or doublehanded, reading of Levinas's work."
                            }
                        ]
